  data: {
    LLM: "1. Players place an Ante bet.\n2. Cards are dealt. Players examine their 5-card hand and choose the best 4-card combination.\n3. Making a Choice: Players must either FOLD (losing the Ante) or make a PLAY bet.\n4. Play Bet: Unlike other games, you can bet 1x, 2x, or 3x your Ante.\n5. The Showdown: The Dealer reveals their 6 cards and makes their best 4-card hand. There is no 'dealer qualify' rule.",
    Player: "1. Players place an Ante bet.\n2. Cards are dealt. Players examine their 5-card hand and choose the best 4-card combination.\n3. Making a Choice: Players must either FOLD (losing the Ante) or make a PLAY bet.\n4. Play Bet: Unlike other games, you can bet 1x, 2x, or 3x your Ante.\n5. The Showdown: The Dealer reveals their 6 cards and makes their best 4-card hand. There is no 'dealer qualify' rule.",
